From fdf8e1e8e2843fffe9a7661c9fca2bb5014c8cf4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Entrpi <entrpi@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 1 Feb 2026 01:06:44 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 006/145] drm/panthor: Add CIX Sky1 GPU support

Add Sky1-specific modifications to the Panthor GPU driver on top of
v6.19-rc7's improved codebase (panthor_pwr, panthor_hw refactor,
UAF/race fixes, multi-power-domain support via devm_pm_domain_attach_list).

Sky1-specific additions:
- GPU reset control for Sky1 power-on sequence per CIX TRM:
  power domain on -> clock enable -> reset assert -> deassert ->
  qchannel clock gating enable
- RCSU register mapping for GPU power control and core harvesting
- Shader core harvesting via RCSU for dynamic core scaling (DCS)
- Backup clock support (gpu_clk_200M, gpu_clk_400M)
- PHBA/cache configuration for G720 on Sky1
- OPP table existence check with graceful ENODEV fallback
